Action Input: {}

Thought: The mass spectrometry data provides the m/z values, with the most intense peak at m/z 182.0732, which likely corresponds to the molecular ion peak. To determine the molecular formula, I will use this m/z value to find possible molecular formulas that match this mass. I will now use the molecular formula tool to find isomers based on this mass.
Action: obtain_isomers_from_molecular_formula
Action Input: {"molecular_formula": "C10H14O2"}

Thought: I have obtained a list of possible isomers for the molecular formula C10H14O2. To further narrow down the possibilities, I should analyze the NMR spectra, starting with the proton NMR, to identify characteristic chemical shifts and coupling patterns that can help identify the correct structure.
